:00+00:00\",\"model\":\"claude-sonnet-5-5\",\"prompt_version\":\"report_v1\",\"data_version\":\"0f13c23f6552fa07\",\"report\":{\"executive_summary\":[{\"claim_id\":\"executive_summary_0\",\"text\":\"NVIDIA sells accelerated computing platforms used for applications that range from molecular simulation to climate forecasting.\",\"source_ids\":[\"15_1_3\"],\"confidence_label\":\"strongly_supported\",\"internal_confidence\":null},{\"claim_id\":\"executive_summary_1\",\"text\":\"Profitability stayed high in fiscal 2026: the operating margin was 60.4% and the net margin 55.6%.\",\"source_ids\":[\"derived:NVDA:operating_margin:FY2026\",\"derived:NVDA:net_margin:FY2026\"],\"confidence_label\":\"strongly_supported\",\"internal_confidence\":null},{\"claim_id\":\"executive_summary_2\",\"text\":\"The latest annual report adds a risk factor about counterparty exposure in commercial arrangements.\",\"source_ids\":[\"15_1A_152\"],\"confidence_label\":\"supported\",\"internal_confidence\":null}],\"company_overview\":[{\"claim_id\":\"company_overview_0\",\"text\":\"The company's networking products include interconnects, switches, adapters and the software that ties them into data-center-scale systems.\",\"source_ids\":[\"15_1_5\"],\"confidence_label\":\"strongly_supported\",\"internal_confidence\":null},{\"claim_id\":\"company_overview_1\",\"text\":\"Its computing platform is used by researchers and developers across thousands of applications.\",\"source_ids\":[\"15_1_3\"],\"confidence_label\":\"supported\",\"internal_confidence\":null}],\"revenue_analysis\":[{\"claim_id\":\"revenue_analysis_0\",\"text\":\"Much of the company's revenue reaches it through OEMs, ODMs, system integrators and distributors rather than directly from end customers.\",\"source_ids\":[\"15_1A_152\"],\"confidence_label\":\"supported\",\"internal_confidence\":null},{\"claim_id\":\"revenue_analysis_uncited\",\"text\":\"This sentence has no source and must never be shown.\",\"source_ids\":[],\"confidence_label\":\"supported\",\"internal_confidence\":null}],\"profitability_analysis\":[{\"claim_id\":\"profitability_analysis_0\",\"text\":\"Gross margin was 71.1% in fiscal 2026, down from 75.0% a year earlier.\",\"source_ids\":[\"derived:NVDA:gross_margin:FY2026\",\"derived:NVDA:gross_margin:FY2025\"],\"confidence_label\":\"strongly_supported\",\"internal_confidence\":null},{\"claim_id\":\"profitability_analysis_1\",\"text\":\"The filing does not break the margin change down by product line, so the cause of the decline is not established here.\",\"source_ids\":[\"derived:NVDA:gross_margin:FY2026\"],\"confidence_label\":\"limited_evidence\",\"internal_confidence\":null}],\"balance_sheet_analysis\":[{\"claim_id\":\"balance_sheet_analysis_0\",\"text\":\"Total debt was $8.5 billion at the end of fiscal 2026, about 5% of shareholders' equity.\",\"source_ids\":[\"derived:NVDA:total_debt:FY2026\",\"derived:NVDA:debt_to_equity:FY2026\"],\"confidence_label\":\"strongly_supported\",\"internal_confidence\":null}],\"cash_flow_analysis\":[{\"claim_id\":\"cash_flow_analysis_0\",\"text\":\"Free cash flow was $96.7 billion in fiscal 2026.\",\"source_ids\":[\"derived:NVDA:free_cash_flow:FY2026\"],\"confidence_label\":\"strongly_supported\",\"internal_confidence\":null}],\"valuation_analysis\":[],\"news_summary\":[{\"news_id\":\"news:15\",\"summary\":\"Coverage focused on how the market reacted to the company's guidance.\",\"category\":\"earnings\",\"source_ids\":[\"news:15\"]},{\"news_id\":\"news:14\",\"summary\":\"Margins were the main topic in reporting ahead of the earnings release.\",\"category\":\"earnings\",\"source_ids\":[\"news:14\"]}],\"risks\":[{\"category\":\"counterparty\",\"description\":\"Commercial arrangements expose the company to the risk that a counterparty does not perform.\",\"source_ids\":[\"15_1A_152\"],\"change_status\":\"new\",\"evidence_label\":\"supported\"},{\"category\":\"competition\",\"description\":\"Failing to keep up with fast changes in technology, customer requirements and industry standards could hurt results.\",\"source_ids\":[\"15_1A_60\"],\"change_status\":\"reworded\",\"evidence_label\":\"strongly_supported\"},{\"category\":\"supply_chain\",\"description\":\"The company depends on foundries to deliver advanced process technologies on time and at quality.\",\"source_ids\":[\"15_1A_100\"],\"change_status\":\"unchanged\",\"evidence_label\":\"limited_evidence\"}],\"management_commentary\":[{\"topic\":\"data_center\",\"text\":\"Management describes its networking and computing products as one platform for data-center-scale systems.\",\"period\":\"FY2026\",\"speaker\":null,\"source_ids\":[\"15_1_5\"]}],\"bull_factors\":[{\"title\":\"Exceptional profitability\",\"claims\":[{\"claim_id\":\"bull_0_0\",\"text\":\"Return on equity was 76.3% in fiscal 2026, with a net margin of 55.6%.\",\"source_ids\":[\"derived:NVDA:roe:FY2026\",\"derived:NVDA:net_margin:FY2026\"],\"confidence_label\":\"strongly_supported\",\"internal_confidence\":null}],\"counterpoint_source_ids\":[\"derived:NVDA:gross_margin:FY2025\"],\"monitoring_indicator\":\"Gross margin each quarter\"},{\"title\":\"Little debt\",\"claims\":[{\"claim_id\":\"bull_1_0\",\"text\":\"Debt is small next to equity, which leaves room to invest through a downturn.\",\"source_ids\":[\"derived:NVDA:debt_to_equity:FY2026\"],\"confidence_label\":\"supported\",\"internal_confidence\":null}],\"counterpoint_source_ids\":[],\"monitoring_indicator\":null}],\"bear_factors\":[{\"title\":\"Margins have started to slip\",\"claims\":[{\"claim_id\":\"bear_0_0\",\"text\":\"Gross margin fell about four points between fiscal 2025 and fiscal 2026.\",\"source_ids\":[\"derived:NVDA:gross_margin:FY2026\",\"derived:NVDA:gross_margin:FY2025\"],\"confidence_label\":\"strongly_supported\",\"internal_confidence\":null}],\"counterpoint_source_ids\":[\"derived:NVDA:operating_margin:FY2026\"],\"monitoring_indicator\":\"Gross margin each quarter\"},{\"title\":\"Dependence on partners\",\"claims\":[{\"claim_